    "## Last Time \n",
    "\n",
    "Suppose we want to test whether the mean home value differs between Wake County and Mecklenburg County. We'll compare 100 homes randomly selected homes in Wake County with 100 randomly selected homes in Mecklenburg County. The Wake County sample had a mean home value of \\$461,300 with a sample standard deviation of \\$120,000, while the Mecklenburg County sample had a mean home value of \\$406,800 with a sample standard deviation of \\$105,000.\n",
    "\n",
    "How do we know this is a difference in means scenario?\n",
    "\n",
    "## Hypothesis Test \n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "t=\n",
    "\\frac{461{,}300-406{,}800}\n",
    "{\\sqrt{\n",
    "\\frac{120{,}000^2}{100}\n",
    "+\n",
    "\\frac{105{,}000^2}{100}\n",
    "}} = 3.43\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "... and this statistic follows what type of distribution?\n",
    "\n",
    "## Degrees of freedom \n",
